<%- include('partials/header') %>
<main class="city-detail-page">
<section class="section city-detail-hero">
  <div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/cities">Cities</a><span>›</span><%= city.cityName %></div>
  <div class="city-detail-layout">
    <div class="city-detail-copy"><span class="kicker"><span aria-hidden="true">⌖</span> OSIRA · JAIPUR BUSINESS SUPPLY</span><h1><%= city.h1Heading %></h1><p><%= city.heroSubheading || 'Wall clock options for retailers, workplaces, gifting programmes and custom business orders.' %></p><div class="actions"><button class="btn primary" type="button" data-open-enquiry>Get a business quote</button><a class="btn secondary" href="/products">Browse wall clocks</a></div><div class="city-quick-points"><span><b aria-hidden="true">▦</b> Product selection</span><span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b> Bulk enquiries</span><span><b aria-hidden="true">✳</b> Custom branding</span></div></div>
    <div class="city-hero-visual"><img src="<%= city.heroImage || 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497366754035-f200968a6e72?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85' %>" alt="Wall clocks for workplaces and business supply in <%= city.cityName %>" width="1000" height="800" fetchpriority="high"><div><span>OSIRA · RAJASTHAN</span><strong>For retail and business requirements</strong></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="city-facts"><div><span class="city-fact-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌂</span><strong>Jaipur-based</strong><span>Business enquiries</span></div><div><span class="city-fact-icon" aria-hidden="true">▤</span><strong>Wholesale</strong><span>Quantity-led quotations</span></div><div><span class="city-fact-icon" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><strong>Custom orders</strong><span>Branding to discuss</span></div></div>
</section>

<section class="section city-content">
  <article class="city-intro-panel"><span class="kicker">WALL CLOCKS IN <%= city.cityName.toUpperCase() %></span><h2>Find wall clocks for your space, store or business.</h2><div class="rich-copy"><%- city.introContent %></div></article>
  <div class="city-content-grid">
    <% if(city.whyChooseContent){ %><article><span class="city-content-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span class="kicker">WHY OSIRA</span><div class="rich-copy"><%- city.whyChooseContent %></div></article><% } %>
    <% if(city.servicesContent){ %><article><span class="city-content-icon" aria-hidden="true">▦</span><span class="kicker">BUSINESS SERVICES</span><div class="rich-copy"><%- city.servicesContent %></div><div class="inline-links"><a href="/services/wholesale-wall-clocks">Wholesale</a><a href="/services/corporate-gifting">Corporate gifting</a><a href="/services/promotional-wall-clocks">Promotional branding</a><a href="/services/custom-oem-wall-clocks">Custom & OEM</a></div></article><% } %>
    <% if(city.deliveryContent){ %><article><span class="city-content-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="kicker">DELIVERY & COMMERCIAL TERMS</span><div class="rich-copy"><%- city.deliveryContent %><p><strong>Delivery estimate:</strong> Confirm the current timeline for your quantity, destination and selected product before ordering.</p></div></article><% } %>
    <% if(city.industriesContent){ %><article><span class="city-content-icon" aria-hidden="true">◇</span><span class="kicker">WHO WE SUPPORT</span><div class="rich-copy"><%- city.industriesContent %></div></article><% } %>
  </div>
  <% if(city.nearbyAreas){ %><article class="city-nearby-panel"><span class="kicker">LOCATION CONTEXT</span><p><%= city.nearbyAreas %></p></article><% } %>
  <% if(city.closingContent){ %><article class="city-closing-copy"><span class="kicker">NEXT STEP</span><div class="rich-copy"><%- city.closingContent %></div></article><% } %>
</section>

<section class="section city-how-section"><div><span class="kicker">HOW TO GET A QUOTE</span><h2>Three details help us recommend the right route.</h2></div><div class="city-how-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Tell us the use</h3><p>Retail stock, office use, gifting, promotion or a custom-branded requirement.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Share quantity & style</h3><p>Include the approximate quantity, size, design preference and artwork if relevant.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Confirm the order</h3><p>We can discuss suitable options and confirm availability, pricing and delivery details.</p></article></div></section>

<section class="section city-faq-section"><div><span class="kicker">COMMON QUESTIONS</span><h2>Before ordering wall clocks in <%= city.cityName %></h2></div><div class="city-faq-list"><details><summary>Can I enquire about bulk wall clocks?</summary><p>Yes. Share your quantity, preferred designs, use case and delivery city. Current availability and commercial terms can then be confirmed for the requirement.</p></details><details><summary>Can wall clocks be used for corporate gifting or branding?</summary><p>OSIRA accepts enquiries for corporate gifting, promotional and custom-branded requirements. Logo options, artwork, minimum quantities and production timelines must be confirmed for each order.</p></details><details><summary>How do I confirm price and delivery time?</summary><p>Send the product or collection you are interested in, the quantity and delivery PIN code. Pricing and dispatch estimates depend on the selected product and order details.</p></details></div></section>
<section class="section city-cta"><div><span class="kicker">READY TO SOURCE?</span><h2>Tell us your wall-clock requirement.</h2><p>Get a practical next step based on the product, quantity and destination.</p></div><div class="actions"><button class="btn primary" type="button" data-open-enquiry>Request a quotation →</button><a class="btn secondary" href="https://wa.me/<%= (site?.whatsappNumber || '919509912556').replace(/[^0-9]/g,'') %>?text=<%= encodeURIComponent('Hello OSIRA, I am enquiring about wall clocks in '+city.cityName+'.') %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp OSIRA</a></div></section>
</main><%- include('partials/footer',{site}) %>